sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant API as API (ipm-organization-api)
  participant DB as SSOT (banco ssot)
  participant P as Publisher (ipm-organization-publisher)
  participant NATS as NATS (Stream DESIRED)
  participant CTRL as Controller (ipm-organization-controller)
  participant ZIT as Zitadel (OrgService)

  U->>API: POST /v1/ipm/organizations {name, billingAccountId, deletionProtection}
  API->>API: valida token JWT, permissão ipm.organization.create, cota por dono
  API->>API: valida billingAccountId via projeção local (BillingAccountProjection)
  API->>DB: Transação SQL: INSERT ipm.organization (Pending), INSERT outbox, INSERT idempotency
  API-->>U: 201 Created (Resource: phase Pending, generation 1)
  P->>DB: drena outbox pendente por ordem de sequence
  P->>NATS: publica desired.ipm.organization.<id>
  P->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET published_at = now()
  NATS->>CTRL: entrega desired.changed (Informer -> Workqueue)
  CTRL->>DB: lê intenção vigente no SSOT
  CTRL->>ZIT: observa se a organização já existe
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 404 Not Found (absent)
  CTRL->>ZIT: cria organização no Zitadel e configura userAccess
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK
  CTRL->>ZIT: reobserva organização
  ZIT-->>CTRL: 200 OK (present, ativa)
  CTRL->>DB: UPDATE ipm.organization SET phase = Ready, observed_generation = generation
